{
  "id": 694,
  "name": "amaze-mulch",
  "fling_power": 30,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "mulch",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/32/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Augmente le nombre total de Baies de 2, augmente les chances de mutation de Baies, et assèche le sol en 4 heures.",
      "short_effect": "Augmente le nombre total de Baies de 2, augmente les chances de mutation de Baies, et assèche le sol en 4 heures.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Increases the total number of Berries by 2, increases the chance of Berry mutation, and causes soil to dry out in 4 hours.",
      "short_effect": "Increases the total number of Berries by 2, increases the chance of Berry mutation, and causes soil to dry out in 4 hours.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "たわわこやし　びっくりこやし\nぐんぐんこやしの　とくちょうを\nすべて　そなえた　すごい　こやし。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "주렁주렁비료와 깜놀비료,\n부쩍부쩍비료의 특징을\n모두 지닌 굉장한 비료.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un engrais servant à faire pousser des Baies.\nIl combine les effets du Fertibondance,\ndu Fertistantané et du Fertibérance.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mulch zur Nutzung auf Beerenfeldern.\nEin Spitzenmulch, der die Wirkung von Wucher-,\nWunder- und Sprießmulch in sich vereint.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una de las misteriosas Megapiedras. Permite\nmegaevolucionar a Abomasnow en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un fertilizzante incredibile che combina gli effetti\ndi Fertilflorido, Fertilsorpresa e Fertilcopioso.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mulch to be used in a Berry field.\nAn amazing Mulch with the effects\nof Rich, Surprise, and Boost Mulch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "たわわこやし　びっくりこやし\nぐんぐんこやしの　特徴を\nすべて　備えた　すごい　こやし。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una de las misteriosas Megapiedras. Permite\nmegaevolucionar a Abomasnow en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "きのみを　そだてるときの　ひりょう。\nしかし　ホウエンちほうの　つちには\nまるで　なじまないので　こうかが　ない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "나무열매를 키울 때 사용하는 비료.\n그러나 호연지방의 흙에는\n전혀 맞지 않기에 효과가 없다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "培育樹果時的肥料。\n但完全不適合豐緣地區的土壤，\n所以沒什麼效果。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un engrais à utiliser sur un sol meuble.\nIl n’est cependant pas adapté aux terres\nde Hoenn et n’y a aucun effet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mulch zur Nutzung auf Beerenfeldern. Durch seine\nUnverträglichkeit mit den Böden in Hoenn bleibt\nsein Einsatz dort ohne Wirkung.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un fertilizante usado para el cultivo de bayas.\nParece que no se asienta bien en el suelo de\nHoenn, por lo que no tiene efecto en esta región.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fertilizzante usato per coltivare le bacche.\nTuttavia, non ha effetto a Hoenn, perché\nnon è adatto al terreno della regione.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A fertilizer for growing Berries. However, it appears\nto be unsuitable for the soil in the Hoenn region and\nhas no effect.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
